    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"controlled opinion risk\" sounds like a fancy way of saying we're just waiting to be canceled. if the \"uncommitted\" side is constantly critiquing us, doesn't that eventually turn into a death spiral for the brand? if you were in my shoes, wouldn't you just bite the bullet and back the mandate so we can at least stand for something instead of just being targets for everyone?",
